ote=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-typed-many-one-reduction</span><span>73-definition-8.5</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§9.3, print pp. 390–401; PDF pp. 412–423; local typed effective reduction/coding"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§8.4–8.7, pp. 185–207; local total computable reduction abstraction"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"9"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\Sigma^*\\}\">\\(X\\in\\{\\mathbb N,\\Sigma^*\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq X\">\\(A,B\\subseteq X\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 仅在词载体分支使用；数值分支的定义与该辅助字母表无关。</li>\n<li>数值函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{NumComp}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a>；词函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd9e85296ed6a24d\" href=\"?note=fd9e85296ed6a24d\" title=\"73-df-string-function-computation\">73-df-string-function-computation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 保留原总函数接口；本文件显式固定其载体实例，不混合词与数值应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{NumComp},&amp;X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}(M,f)\\},&amp;X=\\Sigma^*,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathrm{NumComp},&amp;X=\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\;\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}(M,f)\\},&amp;X=\\Sigma^*,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Computable}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}8.5}\\vdash\nA\\leq_mB\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{Computable}\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-string-function-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数值函数类 $\\mathrm{NumComp}$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]；词函数的 $\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-string-function-computation","status":"resolved","id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数值函数类 $\\mathrm{NumComp}$ 见 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]；词函数的 $\\operatorname{Computes}_{\\Sigma,\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-string-function-computation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\{\\math